sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as The user
  participant app as App
  participant db
  user->>app: solid arrow
  app-->>user: dotted arrow
  user->app: solid line
  app-->user: dotted line
  user-xapp: solid cross
  app--xuser: dotted cross
  user-)app: solid async
  app--)user: dotted async
  user<<->>app: both ways
  user<<-->>app: both ways dotted
  app->>app: to itself
  user->>+app: activates app
  app-->>-user: deactivates app
  activate db
  deactivate db
  Note left of user: left
  Note right of app: right
  Note over db: over
  Note over user,app: spanning<br>two lines
  loop every minute
    app->>db: poll
  end
  alt found
    db-->>app: row
  else missing
    db-->>app: nothing
  end
  opt cache
    app->>app: store
  end
  par first
    app->>db: read
  and second
    app->>db: write
  end
  critical connect
    app->>db: open
  option timeout
    app->>user: retry
  end
  break failure
    app->>user: error
  end
  rect rgb(200, 200, 255)
    app->>user: highlighted
  end
